WARNING: Illegal reflective access by org.tp23.jgoodies.plaf.plastic.common.ShadowPopupMenuUtils (file:/opt/local/GIT_GOV/govway_3.3_jdk11/lib/antinstaller/jgoodies-edited-1.2.2.jar) to method javax.swing.Popup.getComponent()
